# Stow packages for Omarchy (https://omarchy.org).
#
# Omarchy owns terminal, editor, tmux and prompt configs (nvim, kitty, ghostty,
# alacritty, tmux, starship) and swaps them when changing themes, so only the
# shell layer and tool configs it doesn't manage are linked here.
shell
zsh
git
bin
fd
gitui
claude
scripts
